  "text": "proprium.sancti-ioannis-apostoli-et-evangelistae-tractus",
  "about": "The tractus of the formulary “Saint John, Apostle and Evangelist” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Blessed is the man who fears the Lord; he longs greatly for His commandments. His offspring will be mighty on earth; the generation of the upright will be blessed. Glory and riches are in his house, and his justice endures forever and ever." }
